description:
HYPOTHESIS: formatText applies attributes, getFormat returns applied styles.

ASSERTIONS:
- [ ] Select text, apply bold: getFormat returns { bold: true }
- [ ] Select text, apply italic: getFormat returns { italic: true }
- [ ] Select text, apply code: getFormat returns { code: true }
- [ ] getDeltasByRange returns deltas with attributes

ROOT CAUSE: useEffect in BlockSuiteEditor.tsx:382 includes onReady in dependency array.

When test components pass inline callbacks:
```tsx
useBlockSuiteEditor({
  onReady: () => { /* new function every render */ }
})
```

Each render creates new onReady ref → effect re-runs → editor reinitializes.

FIX: Use ref for onReady callback, remove from deps. Editor should init once, call latest callback.
